Package: ssdplus
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: 疯狂的大叔 <HUiTHEME@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), systemd, python3 (>= 3.8), smartmontools
Description: SSD Assistant - SSD health and lifespan monitor
 Reads total reads and writes, live throughput, temperature and health for
 every SSD, decodes SMART attributes such as wear level, power-on hours,
 unexpected power loss and media errors, and charts long-term trends as a
 calendar heatmap. Runs as a dedicated non-root user and only listens on a
 Unix socket behind the TOS API gateway.
